<title>USA: Incstar says to make announcement.</title>
<headline>Incstar says to make announcement.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Incstar Corp, a small manufacturer of clinical and medical test, said it expects to make a material announcement at 1200 EST (1700 GMT) Friday.</p>
<p>Sorin Biomedica SpA, an affiliate of Fiat SpA, owns about 53 percent of Incstar.  </p>
<p>The Stillwater, Minn.-based company reported 1995 net income of $4.2 million on sales of $45.7 million.</p>
<p>Chief executive John Booth said in mid-1995 that the company was seeking strategic solutions for its long-term future.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
